<%- include('../partials/top') %>
<div class="page-head">
  <div>
    <h1>Tax forms</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">As an employee of <%= settings.company_name %>, taxes are taken out of each paycheck, and you get a Form W-2 each January.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="card card-pad">
  <div class="card-title-row">
    <h2>Your W-4 and DE 4</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-sm <%= w4 ? '' : 'btn-primary' %>" href="/my/tax/w4"><%= w4 ? 'Update' : 'Fill in now' %></a>
  </div>
  <% if (!w4) { %>
    <p>These tell us how much federal and California income tax to take out of your pay. It takes about five minutes. Until you fill them in, the rules say we must withhold as if you were single with no adjustments, which may take out more than you need.</p>
  <% } else { %>
    <dl class="dl">
      <dt>Name</dt><dd><%= w4.legal_name %></dd>
      <dt>Withholding</dt><dd><%= summary %></dd>
      <dt>Social Security number</dt><dd>***-**-<%= w4.ssn_last4 %></dd>
      <dt>Signed</dt><dd><%= w4.signed_name %>, <%= fmtDateTime(w4.signed_at) %><%= w4.entered_by ? ' (entered by the office from your paper forms)' : '' %></dd>
    </dl>
    <p class="hint">Life changed (married, a new baby, a second job)? Update them, and the next pay run uses the new answers.</p>
  <% } %>
</section>

<section class="card card-pad">
  <h2>How you get your W-2</h2>
  <% if (!w4) { %>
    <p class="muted">Fill in your W-4 and DE 4 first.</p>
  <% } else if (w4.electronic_consent) { %>
    <p><%- badge('Online', 'green') %> You agreed on <%= fmtDateTime(w4.consent_at) %> to get your W-2 here instead of on paper.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/my/tax/w2-consent" data-confirm="Switch to getting your W-2 on paper?">
      <%- include('../partials/csrf') %>
      <input type="hidden" name="agree" value="0">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm">Switch to paper</button>
    </form>
  <% } else { %>
    <p><%- badge('On paper', 'gray') %> The office will give or mail you a paper copy. You can choose to get it online here instead:</p>
    <form method="post" action="/my/tax/w2-consent" class="consent-box">
      <%- include('../partials/csrf') %>
      <input type="hidden" name="agree" value="1">
      <ul class="plain-list small">
        <li>If you agree, your Form W-2 will be put in this account instead of being given to you on paper. If you don't agree, you'll get it on paper.</li>
        <li>This covers every W-2 from <%= settings.company_name %>, until you change your mind.</li>
        <li>You can still ask the office for a paper copy at any time, even after agreeing.</li>
        <li>You can stop at any time with the "Switch to paper" button here, or by telling the office in writing. We'll confirm the change.</li>
        <li>Online copies stop if you no longer work for <%= settings.company_name %> or your account is closed; you'll get paper instead. Your W-2 stays available here until at least October 15 of the following year.</li>
        <li>The office will tell you when your W-2 is ready. Keep your contact details up to date so they can reach you.</li>
        <li>You need a phone or computer with a web browser and a PDF viewer (almost all have one), and a way to save or print the file.</li>
      </ul>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="understand" value="1"> I have read this and agree to get my W-2 online.</label>
      <div class="form-actions"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Get my W-2 online</button></div>
    </form>
  <% } %>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <div class="card-head"><h2>Your W-2s</h2></div>
  <% if (!w2s.length) { %>
    <p class="empty">None here yet. Your W-2 for each year is ready by January 31 of the next year.</p>
  <% } else { %>
    <ul class="list">
      <% for (const f of w2s) { %><li><span>Form W-2 for <%= f.tax_year %></span><a class="btn btn-sm" href="/my/tax/w2/<%= f.id %>">Download</a></li><% } %>
    </ul>
  <% } %>
</section>

<section class="card card-pad">
  <h2>Your pay stubs</h2>
  <p>Every pay stub, with the taxes taken out and your paid sick leave, is under <a href="/my/pay">My pay</a>.</p>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/bottom') %>
